### Caveats
- Coniferous/Broad-leaved forest and scrub/rock share estimates rest on n=1-5
  invaded plots: the "exclusive" dominance style in forests is directionally strong
  but low-powered; regression evidence over all 191 invaded plots supports the
  urban/cropland negative and road-distance positive effects.
- Coordinates are UTM-projected (columns labeled longitude/latitude); mapping only.
- Temporal table is Catalonia-wide; habitat/plot data are Barcelona province; used
  strictly as interpretive backdrop.
